OL,3,GNEWSAError may cost council tax payers
OL,4,A#10m, report says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mistake by Bradford Council in 2018
OL,7,Fcould cost tax payers over #10m, a
OL,8,Freport has claimed.
OL,10,FA policy introduced by Labour eight
OL,11,Fyears ago to charge owners of long-term
OL,12,Fempty properties higher council tax was
OL,13,Fnot ratified by the full council,
OL,14,Fmeaning it was never fully authorised,
OL,15,Faccording to Reform UK, which now leads
OL,16,Fthe authority.
OL,18,FReform said the premiums charged on
OL,19,Fthose property owners between 2019-24 `
OL,20,Fintended to encourage owners to bring
OL,21,Fempty homes back into use ` now needed
OL,22,Fto be returned.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
