OL,3,GNEWSAError may cost council tax payers
OL,4,A#10m, report says
OL,5,
OL,6,FBradford's Reform group said it was an
OL,7,F"awful error" and called for Labour
OL,8,Fcouncillor Imran Khan, deputy leader of
OL,9,Fthe council at the time, to resign, but
OL,10,FKhan said that was "cheap politics".
